SUMMARY
Sunlands Aeronautics and Space Administration (SASA) is the esteemed government agency of the United Sunlands responsible for the civil space program, aeronautics research, and space research.
Hard-level scenario blending cloud investigation with APT hunting. Cloud-native hunt techniques are a growing requirement in senior hunter JDs. Completing this demonstrates the ability to hunt across hybrid cloud environments — the hardest and most valued hunt skill.

LEARNING OBJECTIVES
- Identify foreign infrastructure through domain analysis. You will spot foreign TLDs and email providers as clues to attacker origins.
- Trace watering hole attacks. You will uncover a fake International Space Summit website used to lure employees into downloading malware.
- Follow privilege escalation from user to domain admin. You will trace how attackers escalate from an initial compromised account to full domain control in under two hours.
- Identify persistence and credential dumping. You will find when attackers established mechanisms to maintain access and when they harvested passwords.
- Pivot across attacker infrastructure. You will chain domain-to-IP and IP-to-domain relationships to map the full scope of attacker infrastructure.
- Track data staging and exfiltration. You will find the staged file containing national secrets and trace where it was sent.

