Section 2: Yeeted Into Space
What is the domain the attackers used to compromise SASA employees interested in the International Space Summit?
Email
| where link contains "Summit"
| distinct link
Answer: Intlspacesummit2123.info

Which top-level domain (TLD) used by the attacker suggests evidence of foreign interference?
OutboundNetworkEvents
| where url contains "Intlspacesummit2123.info" and url contains "redirect"
Answer: lu
This one took some nudging from the Discord.

What was the most common file (name) that victims downloaded from the attacker domains in Q2?
FileCreationEvents
| where filename has_any ("SpaceportProposal.docx", "SpaceInvestmentProjections.xlsx", "AsteroidMiningBrief.ppt")
| summarize dcount(path) by filename
Answer: AsteroidMiningBrief.ppt

Right after the victims downloaded the files from Q3, the attackers ran a command to connect to their infrastructure. What is the password?
Get the timestamp and hostname for the first one:
FileCreationEvents
| where filename == "AsteroidMiningBrief.ppt"
7/2/2123, 3:00:04 PM, ZKV8-MACHINE
ProcessEvents
| where hostname == "ZKV8-MACHINE"
| where timestamp > datetime(7/2/2123, 3:00:04 PM)
