The attackers ran commands to discover more about their victims’ network. What is the hostname of the first victim with these commands? This includes compromised hosts that may have been impacted outside of the file in Q3.
let comp_hosts=
FileCreationEvents
| where filename has_any ("SpaceportProposal.docx", "SpaceInvestmentProjections.xlsx", "AsteroidMiningBrief.ppt")
| distinct hostname;
ProcessEvents
| where hostname in (comp_hosts)
| where timestamp > datetime(7/1/2123, 2:55:20 PM) //First time the file was seen
